{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787042219587025001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"illusory-patronal-giraffe","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"9376d6545ab745dc80e98ce3c197b745ba6016e898285974f30ae551d4e6930c","event_uuid":"f39e4c21-2ab4-4a5c-ac28-5f42e6bf8af9","position":{"commit_sha":"ea60ba9cc22c5339517c4c6efce151c89da6b8e7","position":"1787036454809590001-f39e4c21-2ab4-4a5c-ac28-5f42e6bf8af9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ce147901cfab1ff18ac0fe9b28adcfa2a8e0943e51828e3f0365cba69f4f3fa6","event_uuid":"86dbb646-68f7-47fb-a215-60c2f0e56f9e","position":{"commit_sha":"b5c88212d4f2c2d99f5e86c483133e7a33d7a3b5","position":"1787036477751218001-86dbb646-68f7-47fb-a215-60c2f0e56f9e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787036454809590001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"86dbb646-68f7-47fb-a215-60c2f0e56f9e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"6f14-21a7-d806-44b2"}],"description":"Advisory from S6 (6f14) LLM code review (Gerrit 1850). When the op-cert signer is composed from the inline-PEM source REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY (src/rebar/opcert_service/config.py from_env), the raw Ed25519 private key remains in os.environ for the process lifetime and is inherited by every child process (ssh-keygen subprocesses in keyprov, git pushes). The DEPLOYED path uses REBAR_OPCERT_KEY_PATH (a mounted 0600 file), not inline PEM, so this affects only the secondary/dev inline-PEM path. Remediation: after compose_signer consumes private_key, pop REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY from os.environ without breaking config-reload semantics. Deferred from S6 to avoid rushing a config-load side-effect change on a non-deployed path.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"932d-52d8-1d59-426c","ticket_type":"task","title":"Harden op-cert inline-PEM path: unset REBAR_OPCERT_PRIVATE_KEY from os.environ after compose","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f39e4c21-2ab4-4a5c-ac28-5f42e6bf8af9","86dbb646-68f7-47fb-a215-60c2f0e56f9e"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787042219587025001,"uuid":"998d98eb-3471-4a95-888e-04784f43b35b"}